  [PASS] S8 [THE DATA PREFER THE TIDE] if truncation were TIDAL rather than
      smooth-field, almost nothing would be truncated and every object
      would sit on the isolated line
         measured:  tidal prescription: 1/32 capped; EFE prescription: 24/32 capped; median |log10| of the isolated line over the tidal-safe 31 = 0.219 dex
